          {
            "id": "2112331270386860113",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We fixed the guide in September. So a surge is not a free move, it is a better place in line. Does that change which stack you finish first? https://t.co/pxHT7VwELS",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112331382869615008"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:53:14.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2112331270386860113"
        ],
        "id": "2112331270386860113",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 9,
          "like_count": 1,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Our own guide got Morale wrong. It said a Morale unit gets another action. The engine never gives one. Morale moves the unit ahead of the queue and it hits a quarter harder. Dismorale sends it behind everyone, hitting softer. One turn either way.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112331270386860113"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-19T18:56:32.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2112256603600638111"
        ],
