        "id": "2112256493034623098",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 8,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "The first move is a handshake. A step that does not claim a cell, a lane, or an aura range told the other player nothing.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112256493034623098"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:53:59.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2112180463754231965"
        ],
        "id": "2112180463754231965",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 3,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2112180382678610386",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Health says whether it can take a hit. The queue says whether that hit arrives before you can move it.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112180463754231965"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:53:40.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2112180382678610386"
        ],
        "id": "2112180382678610386",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 10,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Before you move a wounded stack: do you check who acts next, or do you check how much health it has left?",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2112180382678610386"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-18T23:55:55.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
