          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Nature can lose the straight brawl and still win, if the other player chased one stack into a board that no longer has a way out.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111969404565250121"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:52:24.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111893175274983766"
