        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111892951626350973",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Protect purpose, not just hit points: https://t.co/9PkBIH6oWG",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111893175274983766"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-18T18:51:31.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111892951626350973"
        ],
        "id": "2111892951626350973",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 12,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Pinning a ranged stack is not a hit on that stack. It is a hit on the reason the rest of the army was standing there.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111892951626350973"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-18T13:59:44.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111819523087081888"
        ],
        "id": "2111819523087081888",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 6,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111819309269835920",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "We delete the outer cells on purpose. I want the opening you would actually play, not the one that looks brave.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111819523087081888"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-18T13:58:53.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111819309269835920"
        ],
        "id": "2111819309269835920",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 15,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "If you learned flanking in Heroes of Might and Magic: do you still open on the edge when that edge is going to disappear?",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111819309269835920"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:53:00.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111606435058684023"
        ],
        "id": "2111606435058684023",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 8,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111606394281500728",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "The faction is weight, and the weight has to be earned: https://t.co/ap7MlsdVIX",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111606435058684023"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T23:52:50.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111606394281500728"
        ],
        "id": "2111606394281500728",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 14,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Might is not walking forward and hoping the hit arrives. It is building a contact the other army cannot step out of.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111606394281500728"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:59:38.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111532605841588606"
        ],
        "id": "2111532605841588606",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 4,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111532527114506733",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Give the ranged line and the healer different cells: https://t.co/9PkBIH6oWG",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111532605841588606"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T18:59:19.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111532527114506733"
        ],
        "id": "2111532527114506733",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 9,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Packing the army into one knot feels loyal. The first area hit is why it was not.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111532527114506733"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:56:37.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111456352145154096"
        ],
        "id": "2111456352145154096",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 4,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111456161060815313",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Through Shot carries the hit through the targets. The fix is the file, not more armor. Play it: https://t.co/gdYw9HVfcS",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111456352145154096"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-17T13:55:52.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111456161060815313"
        ],
        "id": "2111456161060815313",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 10,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Tsar Cannon does not stop on the first stack. Three units in a file is one shot you lined up for them. https://t.co/DfiPpCBiFm",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111456161060815313"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T23:58:34.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111245446819811489"
        ],
        "id": "2111245446819811489",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 7,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111245321292423194",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Life is stubborn, not safe: https://t.co/ap7MlsdVIX",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111245446819811489"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T23:58:04.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111245321292423194"
        ],
        "id": "2111245321292423194",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 13,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "A Life army that only heals, and never steps forward, runs out of board. The saved stack still needs a cell to matter on.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111245321292423194"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T18:52:38.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111168457140302204"
        ],
        "id": "2111168457140302204",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 3,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111168270522822947",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Same day, we fixed a player who dropped for a second and lost their seat for the rest of the match. Now they come back into the fight. PvP is mostly that kind of work.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111168457140302204"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T18:51:53.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111168270522822947"
        ],
        "id": "2111168270522822947",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 11,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "A bug from last month: every time the board shrank, it flashed back to full size for one frame before the cut ring vanished again.\n\nFor one frame, the board lied about the one rule the game is built on. The fix keeps the layers that already shrank and only draws the new ring.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111168270522822947"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T13:58:10.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111094354408530359"
        ],
        "id": "2111094354408530359",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 8,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2111094220920643925",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Five positioning habits, including the edge: https://t.co/9PkBIH6WMe",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111094354408530359"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "conversation_id": "2111094220920643925",
        "created_at": "2026-10-16T13:57:39.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2111094220920643925"
        ],
        "id": "2111094220920643925",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 15,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Standing on the edge can be the right cell. Staying there is how a shrinking map writes your next turn for you.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2111094220920643925"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "conversation_id": "2110882073452167680",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T23:54:53.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2110882131291635810"
        ],
        "id": "2110882131291635810",
        "in_reply_to_user_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 10,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 0,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "2110882073452167680",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Four banners, and none of them is a tier list: https://t.co/ap7MlsdVIX",
        "url": "https://x.com/Heroes0fcrypto/status/2110882131291635810"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1768370292353884160",
        "conversation_id": "2110882073452167680",
        "created_at": "2026-10-15T23:54:39.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "2110882073452167680"
        ],
        "id": "2110882073452167680",
        "public_metrics": {
          "bookmark_count": 0,
          "impression_count": 15,
          "like_count": 0,
          "quote_count": 0,
          "reply_count": 1,
          "retweet_count": 0
        },
        "text": "Chaos is not a rush. You wait until one enemy unit is out of place, then make the rest of the fight an answer to that.",
